In .NET 10 (Android 15+), `WindowSoftInputModeAdjust.Resize` is deprecated and no longer functions. The replacement is **edge-to-edge insets handling** via `WindowInsets`.

**Recommended approach — use `KeyboardAccelerators` / `Ime` insets:**

In your `MainActivity` or a custom handler, opt into edge-to-edge and listen for keyboard insets:

```csharp
// Platforms/Android/MainActivity.cs
using Android.Views;
using AndroidX.Core.View;

protected override void OnCreate(Bundle? savedInstanceState)
{
    base.OnCreate(savedInstanceState);

    // Enable edge-to-edge
    WindowCompat.SetDecorFitsSystemWindows(Window, false);

    // React to keyboard (IME) insets
    ViewCompat.SetOnApplyWindowInsetsListener(Window.DecorView, new InsetsListener());
}

private class InsetsListener : Java.Lang.Object, IOnApplyWindowInsetsListener
{
    public WindowInsetsCompat OnApplyWindowInsets(View v, WindowInsetsCompat insets)
    {
        var imeInsets = insets.GetInsets(WindowInsetsCompat.Type.Ime());
        var navInsets = insets.GetInsets(WindowInsetsCompat.Type.NavigationBars());

        // Apply bottom padding = max(keyboard, nav bar)
        v.SetPadding(v.PaddingLeft, v.PaddingTop, v.PaddingRight,
            Math.Max(imeInsets.Bottom, navInsets.Bottom));

        return insets;
    }
}
```

**Or, purely in XAML** — wrap your page in a `Grid` and place the input in a row that responds to safe-area/keyboard changes by setting `android:windowSoftInputMode="adjustResize"` in `AndroidManifest.xml` **plus** setting `DecorFitsSystemWindows = false`:

```xml
<!-- Platforms/Android/AndroidManifest.xml -->
<activity android:windowSoftInputMode="adjustResize" ... />
```

The key change: in .NET 10 / Android 15, `adjustResize` only works when you **also** set `DecorFitsSystemWindows(Window, false)`. Without that call, the system ignores the resize mode.

**TL;DR:**
1. Call `WindowCompat.SetDecorFitsSystemWindows(Window, false)` in `OnCreate`.
2. Keep `adjustResize` in the manifest.
3. Handle IME insets to add bottom padding (as shown above).
